CORDIS Rust is a clean-room Rust reimplementation aligned to CORDIS v0.5.1
(commit e701869a32c53388db07f06c6ec15baa07167555), which is distributed under
the MIT License. The Rust implementation keeps the public cordis.*.v1 JSON
contract family while tightening authorization, transaction, memory-trust and
workflow invariants. It is not an official release of the upstream project.
